WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.312
InfinityGAN asks a bold question: can a model
synthesize images of arbitrary,

00:00:05.392 --> 00:00:11.053
even infinite size, while training only on small
patches on a single consumer GPU?

00:00:11.133 --> 00:00:15.184
Existing high-resolution GANs fail because compute,
memory,

00:00:15.264 --> 00:00:18.125
and data all scale with output resolution.

00:00:18.205 --> 00:00:23.727
InfinityGAN breaks that coupling, disentangling an
image into global appearance,

00:00:23.807 --> 00:00:26.108
local structure, and fine texture,

00:00:26.188 --> 00:00:31.639
and generating any region patch-by-patch from
continuous coordinates, seamless,

00:00:31.719 --> 00:00:34.650
globally consistent, and unbounded in size.
